# Large uncompressed pickle models (>100MB exceeds GitHub push limit)
# Note: GitHub hard blocks single files over 100MB.
# The project includes model/best_adult_income_model_compressed.pkl.gz (64.5 MB) which is tracked.
*.pkl
!model/best_adult_income_model_compressed.pkl.gz
